  "label": "Holocaust",
  "description": "The Holocaust was the systematic, state-sponsored persecution and murder of six million Jews by Nazi Germany and its collaborators during World War II. It involved the use of gas chambers in extermination camps, and is one of the most horrific genocides in human history. The meme references this atrocity by using the word 'gas' in a vulgar context, which is a direct and offensive minimization of the genocide.",
